# Independent Roguelite development area

- This plugin follows the owner's P00.5 decision: build the new game independently of CastleDemo.
- Keep Roguelite C++ in this Runtime module and game assets under `/Game/Roguelite`.
- Do not include or depend on CastleDemo classes, custom PCG nodes, or `/Game/Demo` assets.
- Preserve the existing project defaults, teammate code, Boss implementation, and all pre-existing changes.
- Asset changes must use Unreal Editor or verified Editor APIs. Never edit binary assets as text.
- The development map's GameMode override is local to that map. Do not replace the global default GameMode.
- P00.5 adds no room system, PCG graph, combat, AI, inventory, or persistence.
- The map commandlet only creates the initial named development map and refuses to overwrite it.
